    "scenesThatPass": [
      "ANDIE: -~and I'm Andie Wickman, I'll be your team leader.\nKATHRYN: You're an astronaut -- aren't you? First female pilot?\nANDIE: Hope to be. How'd you know that?\nKATHRYN: I'm... in the Young Astronauts program... Hi, Kathryn Hawlsey.",
      "ANDIE: But now that you re Shuttle Commander, you're gonna have to start to. Aren't you?\nANDIE: And I'm making you Pilot--\nKATHRYN: You can't!\nANDIE: Pilot. Because I'm not sure how well you take orders. But you'll learn. We're all here to learn, right?",
      "ANDIE: And this is our Shuttle Simulator...\nANDIE: The instrument panel is made from actual schematics. Every switch, every readout on the Discovery, is also right here. And most of those swi…\nANDIE: --don't touch anything until you're told.\nKATHRYN: I presume this is a standard airplane type stick.",
      "ANDIE: .. they realized that the capsule might start tumbling once it reentered the atmosphere ~- and the astronaut would have only a few seconds t…\nKATHRYN: Can't be any worse than flying a loop-the~loop...\nANDIE: Right. Not much worse at any rate... i\nANDIE: Grab your stick, with your right hand, grab your stick!",
      "ANDIE: Okay, since everybody's in such a good mood, let's get started. Landing procedure. Let's get the playback-- You'll see the landing strip com…\nKATHRYN: Thank you... You really, this was very...sweet."
    ]
  },
